5,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since it's the first day, we don't have any information yet. Let's keep our observations sharp and see how everyone behaves. I'm looking forward to a logical discussion to find the werewolf.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited! I'll help everyone find the big bad wolf, but I hope we can all have lots of fun while we do it! Who do you think is suspicious?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"It is too early to point fingers. For now, let us simply observe each other's reactions and speech patterns. I will be watching closely to see who is trying too hard to blend in.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Toshio. It is far too early for accusations. Let us simply listen to one another and maintain a calm atmosphere for now.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
