10,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we are all in agreement for now. Since there is no evidence yet, I will focus on analyzing the consistency of everyone's statements as the game progresses. Let's maintain this composure.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Consistency? That sounds like a big word! I'll just follow my gut and look for anyone acting weird. Maybe the werewolf is hiding behind a very serious face! Hehe, this is so exciting!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"Intuition can be useful, Sakura, but it is often misleading. I prefer to rely on concrete patterns. Let us see if anyone's behavior shifts once the first night's results are known.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Patterns are indeed more reliable than intuition. I believe a quiet, observant approach will serve us best. Let us see what the morning brings us.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,I agree! Let's see what happens tomorrow morning. I wonder who the Seer will pick tonight? I hope we can figure this out together! I'm ready for anything!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we've established our general approach, I'll spend the rest of today observing the dynamics between us. Let's be mindful of how we react to the news tomorrow. I'm ready to analyze the results.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm already observing! I'm watching everyone's faces right now! Maybe I'll find a secret clue that nobody else sees. I'm like a little detective! Do you think the werewolf is nervous? Hehe!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"Nervousness can be faked, and silence can be a mask. I will be looking for the subtle contradictions that emerge when the pressure increases. Let us see who remains composed when the first casualty is revealed.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
