46,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Toshio has claimed the Seer role and cleared Jonathan. If no one else claims to be the Seer, we have a strong lead. However, we must consider if this is a play by the werewolf or the possessed.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
