48,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Mizuki's skepticism is expected. However, if I were the werewolf, claiming the Seer role and clearing a random player is a high-risk strategy. I suggest we look for contradictions in the others' behavior instead.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
