50,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm with Jonathan! We have to be careful. But if Toshio is the Seer, he's doing a great job! I don't think anyone is acting weird yet. What do you guys think? Who seems the most suspicious?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
