70,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The fact that Toshio was attacked strongly suggests he is indeed the Seer. The werewolf would naturally want to eliminate the person capable of uncovering them. We must now rely on Toshio's guidance.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
